<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers fully steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select to mainly Choice 2-4 1050-1300 lbs</p>
<p>63.00-64.50, few 64.75-65.00-dozen head each. Select</p>
<p>61.00-63.50.    Slaughter Heifers: Select to often Choice 2-4 950-1250 lbs</p>
<p>63.00-64.50. Select 60.00-63.00.</p>
</text>
